{"data":{"body":"[P2] Reject truncated service errors before comparing replay\n\nUnlike `_decoded()`, this function discards the envelope without checking `Truncated`. A StepFailed error with `Truncated: true` consequently becomes ordinary type/message evidence and produces no collection error. If those retained fields match the checkpoint snapshot, replay can pass despite explicitly incomplete service evidence. Reject truncated errors before unwrapping them and add a regression alongside the service-output tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOTa1Cx88AAAABEazmIA","finding_digest":"fcb67412f149129d0baed03d38eb0706bef018a52a651ec20938b58919a0a6a3","finding_id":"arf_v1_7s3hiexrjejj2c5o2a6tr2yha2","finding_key":"lmi/source_evidence.py::_error::truncated-error-acceptance","identity_key":"lmi/source_evidence.py::_error::truncated-error-acceptance","line":63,"observation_digest":"28dc346a63c5ceea6d4d45672677107407d6feac79144324090c7e33f4d6ca5e","observation_id":"aro_v1_fdodi2tdyxhou3knivtsm5yqoq","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests/src/aws_durable_execution_conformance_tests/lmi/source_evidence.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-11-16T21:02:15Z","review_id":"arr_v1_tc4czfqdlkdoxjjc65zlzy4ham","reviewed_base_sha":"30915949a9f08023f6227357338d3a7cf1495313","reviewed_head_sha":"793ecdc6b3528433e80da25622c85749ff8b1323","reviewer":"codex","start_line":62,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_olkymnyqihzlcsoqnxnh2xm4qh"},"pull_request":{"number":186},"record_id":"art_v1_zerf3waux22vp3tcad6c27ewnp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-11-16T21:02:15Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-conformance-tests","id":1303200455},"schema_version":1}
